  - line: 52
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.federation_clocks: Expired and unresolved; no consequence or reset."
  - line: 53
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.campaign_arithmetic: Three completed intervention targets; Umbrageous is the active fourth target."
  - line: 54
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.network_topology: Umbrageous contains a Spire but has no stated SPIRE number or explained relationship to the five-target subset and broader eleven-spire network."
  - line: 55
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.enheduanna_activity: None shown; no transit interference or direct action is attributed to her."
